!==============================================================================
!                                                                             !
!  This file contains variables information for relatively generic plotting   !
!  package. This information is used by plotting programs: "cnt", "ccnt",     !
!  "sec", and "csec".                                                         !
!                                                                             !                         
!  This file is read by the plotting programs using the following FORTRAN     !
!  statement:                                                                 !
!                                                                             !
!     n=0                                                                     !
!     icheck=0                                                                !
!     DO WHILE (icheck.lt.999)                                                !
!       READ (inpvar,*) vid(n), vcode(n), vtype(n), is2d(n),                  !
!    &                  vname1(n), vname2(n), vlabel(n)                       !
!       icheck=id(n)                                                          !
!       n=n+1                                                                 !
!     END DO                                                                  !
!                                                                             !
!  Notice that all variables are read with a free formatted statement.        !
!  This is achieved by placing a comma between variable and by enclosing      !
!  character strings with single quotes.                                      !
!                                                                             !
!  The above variables are described as follows:                              !
!                                                                             !
!    vid         Variable to plot identification (integer).                   !
!                                                                             !
!    vcode       Variable text code identification (six character string).    !
!                                                                             !
!    vtype       Variable type switch (integer).                              !
!                                                                             !
!                  vtype = 1, scalar variable.                                !
!                  vtype = 2, vector variable.                                !
!                  vtype = 3, derived from two scalar variables.              !
!                  vtype = 4, special scalar variable.                        !
!                  vtype = 5, special vector variable.                        !
!                                                                             !
!    is2d        Switch indicating spatial 2D or 3D variables (logical)       !
!                                                                             !
!    vname1      NetCDF name for variable 1 (character string).               !
!                                                                             !
!    vname2      NetCDF name for variable 2 (character string).               !
!                                                                             !
!    vlabel      Variable plot label (character string).                      !
!                                                                             !
!==============================================================================
